msgstr "⟪k:0⟫G-⟪k:1⟫Giselle !"

#: badend4:badend4_44A31671_A439_46D8_82FF_255B41B70C64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29d4cd6cd739b89e3a29e300bcab4ab2ebc1ab01cc0f94351d9081afcf6f5ff8
