#: badend4:badend4_B165DF92_E53D_47AA_BECF_198964743FFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30f086ee044611542338ef1b17efe7d6c085f94cca2bcbaf2259f75ae39161b1
