msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...ni prononcer son nom."

#: badend4:badend4_B166DCAC_D82E_4EAA_9D61_F421F9DFE6F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02bbdcf0592d5be609d8cb27442fe009020b900b4ddc5be784af429a54d8c434
