#: badend4:badend4_C2010BBA_364C_4B99_B028_B226F34AE006
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c625ae924c9400b2f9624981f4a61c2c415bbd07f8a1484dcf1e755beafac055
